276
00:27:08.041 --> 00:27:09.708
- Yes.
- It's the police.

277
00:27:09.791 --> 00:27:11.833
We have to get you out of here. Come on.

278
00:27:13.083 --> 00:27:14.791
May I come in and take a look around?

279
