314
00:29:41.708 --> 00:29:44.166
<i>Police say when they arrived
on the scene at 11:15,</i>

315
00:29:44.250 --> 00:29:48.500
<i>the individual had set fire to his car
following a dispute with his wife.</i>

316
00:29:48.583 --> 00:29:50.666
