360
00:31:48.416 --> 00:31:49.916
<i>...119 Riverside.</i>

361
00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:51.559
<i>You have eyes on Alpha 10?</i>

362
00:31:51.583 --> 00:31:53.303
<i>Confirming Alpha 10
on the ground.</i>

363
00:31:53.333 --> 00:31:56.875
<i>Suspect is a Class 5 Electric
last seen with the missing person,</i>

364
00:31:56.958 --> 00:31:58.125
<i>14-year-old girl.</i>

365
00:31:58.208 --> 00:32:00.458
<i>Alpha 10
confirmed the location with K9.</i>

366
00:32:00.541 --> 00:32:02.791
