367
00:32:16.708 --> 00:32:17.791
Everything's fine.

368
00:32:18.458 --> 00:32:19.583
Just a wellness check.

369
00:32:21.875 --> 00:32:23.875
<i>Two Guardians ready to deploy.</i>

370
00:32:36.333 --> 00:32:37.333
